Z||000000||KnightRyder31||07-30-2000||11:29 PM||||My friend and I were pacing each other on a highway going around 50MPH. BTW, he is the one with the Cavalier. We were talking on our CB's, and he told me that he wanted to see if my (Fire Trap) could keep up with him. I said alright, even though I thought I was going to lose bad. Well, he gunned it, and so did I. He did get the jump on me...until about 65MPH, and then I started to gain on him. When I pulled along side of him, he looked over at me and gave me funny look(a WTF kinda look), and I just smiled whiled I pulled ahead. My speedometer was barried at 85...and then it started going past the odometer!!! I got about 2 and a half car's ahead of him at this point. And then he yelled over the CB to pull over. <BR>I did...we met up at a K-Mart. He told me that we were doing 105MPH when I was just passing him. DAMN!!!!<BR>I dont get it guys...I thought that my Duke was only supost to do about 100MPH tops.<BR>For some reason, my car is becoming faster than when I bought it...and I'm not complaining.||||reg||14
